{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And on the eighth day he shall bring two turtledoves.</b> To exclude the seventh day — or does it perhaps exclude the ninth day? He fixed a time for the offerings and fixed a time for the offerers: just as for the offerings, the eighth day qualifies and from the eighth day onward, so too for the offerers, the eighth day qualifies and from the eighth day onward (there)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:09:39.144136066Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}